  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div>\n<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\">\n<p>You have undergone extensive physical training to gain the following benefits:</p>\n<div class=\"rd__spc-inline-post\"> </div>\n<ul class=\"rd__list\">\n<li class=\"rd__li \">Increase your Strength or Dexterity by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li>\n<li class=\"rd__li \">When you are prone, standing up uses only 5 feet of your movement.</li>\n<li class=\"rd__li \">Climbing doesn't cost you extra movement.</li>\n<li class=\"rd__li \">You can make a running long jump or a running high jump after moving only 5 feet on foot, rather than 10 feet.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
